cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Deep Research: Agentic AI in Geoscience"
message: >-
  If you use this review, its corpus, or its method, please cite it. Cite the
  version you used: each run under outputs/ is immutable and carries its own
  RUN.md with the prompt commit it was produced under.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Janna
    family-names: Blaume
    affiliation: "Department of Earth and Planetary Sciences, ETH Zurich"
    email: jannamieke.blaume@eaps.ethz.ch
repository-code: "https://gitlab.ethz.ch/jblaume/deep-research-agentic-geoscience"
abstract: >-
  A scoping review of LLM-based agentic AI in solid-earth and subsurface
  geoscience: what has been built, how it was evaluated, and how mature it is.
  Descriptive only. The repository holds the versioned research prompts, the
  deterministic harvest and triage scripts, and one immutable output directory
  per run.
keywords:
  - scoping review
  - agentic AI
  - large language models
  - solid-earth geoscience
  - subsurface
  - research software
